  (:Change {at: '2026-11-24T07:16:33+00:00', commit: 'ab814966', detail: 'tests/typing/typing_route.py was deleted', id: 'C393', kind: 'file', sync: 'S4', tick: 5, _vid: 1668}),
  (:Fact {author: 'agent', created: '2026-11-24T07:16:50+00:00', id: 'M2', kind: 'fact', reasons: [], search_text: 'error-handling routing App._find_error_handler', status: 'fresh', tags: ['error-handling', 'routing'], text: 'Flask error handler precedence (sansio App._find_error_handler in src/flask/sansio/app.py): status-code-specific handlers beat exception-class handlers, even when the class handler is on a blueprint and the code handler is on the app. Within each tier, blueprint handlers (from request.blueprints) beat app handlers, then the exception\'s MRO is walked so the most specific class wins. Non-HTTP exceptions have code None, so only the class tier applies to them. Behavior unchanged in 3.1.0; the method moved from flask/app.py to the sansio base class.', tick: 6, _vid: 1669}),
  (:Verification {action: 'superseded', at: '2026-11-24T07:16:50+00:00', by: 'agent', note: 'replaced by M2', _vid: 1670});
